# Secrets for the agent's Claude Code session, loaded by agent-session.
# Lives at ~agent/.config/macagent/agent.env, mode 600, owned by the agent.
#
# Only put credentials here that were created FOR the agent — never your own.
# Prefer one 1Password service-account token scoped to a single vault over
# many individual keys: then this file holds one revocable secret, and the
# agent fetches the rest on demand with `op read`.

# OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN=ops_...
